{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06064","headline":"奉和圣制上巳於望春亭观禊饮应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制上巳於望春亭观禊饮应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长乐青门外，宜春小苑东。\n楼开万井上，辇过百花中。\n画鷁移仙妓，金貂列上公。\n清歌邀落日，妙舞向春风。\n渭水明秦甸，黄山入汉宫。\n君王来祓禊，灞滻亦朝宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}